      "parameters": {
        "width": 480,
        "height": 784,
        "content": "## Chase feedback\n\n(for Events, Operations, etc.)\n\n### How it works\n\n1. Starts with manual trigger to initiate the run.\n2. Retrieves all participants from Google Sheets.\n3. Filters the participants based on specific criteria.\n4. Processes each participant in batches, creating unique IDs.\n5. Matches IDs and sets up email drafts in Gmail.\n6. Loops back if more participants remain.\n\n### Setup steps\n\n- [ ] Configure an OAuth 2 client (type \"Web application\" in the Google console\n- [ ] Then in n8n, we need a Google sheets client\n- [ ] Create your own sheet and form (can use the sample here to see how things work with XLOOKUP, ID, etc.). Select your sheet in \"Get all participants\" and \"Set ID to match later\"\n- [ ] Create a fillable form link (\"Get pre-filled link\" in G-Form)\n- [ ] Change \"Create Mail message\" to include your message - and also your form link (use from link from previous step, adjust similar to sample)\n\n### Customization\n\nPls. customize sheet and form and message sent"
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
